      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Iron Legacy certainly happens <em>after</em> the V5 teamup.&nbsp;Iron Legacy has quotes from the issue Freedom Five Annual <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#25There</span> are multiple quotes found from the V5 members from Freedom Five Annual <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#27The</span> Annuals are reserved as the major cross over events for our heros. We can construct rough timelines around them.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Based on what you just listed Foote with the issue numbering, it would leave me with the impression that V5 occurred after Iron Legacy not the other way around&nbsp;</p>",
